sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as infra repository
    participant P as Break-glass account
    participant B as gcp-lz-bootstrap
    participant G as GCS · KMS · IAM
    participant CI as GitHub Actions
    participant L as gcp-lz-* stacks
    R->>R: bootstrap PR merged · gcs backend + encryption, no fallback in the code
    Note over R,CI: the preview only passes G0 and G1 · no federation yet
    P->>B: temporary local backend · tofu apply
    B->>G: lz project · bucket · key ring lz · gh-disasterproject-infra · tf-plan/apply/destroy-lz@
    P->>G: backend restored · TF_ENCRYPTION fallback · tofu init -migrate-state → encrypted state
    P->>P: shred the local state · tofu plan with no changes
    R->>R: PR adds enforced = true (the fallback was never in the code)
    P->>CI: federation coordinates in ci/federation.env · landing-zone Environments
    P->>P: removes projectCreator and owner · account sealed
    CI->>L: PR · landing-zone Environment · tf-apply-lz@
    L->>G: org policies · projects · APIs · identities · KMS · registry · DNS
    L->>L: qa onboarding · cidr · public_id · zone · keys · SAs · BinAuthz rule
    Note over CI,L: the pipeline never applies gcp-lz-bootstrap (DZ8)
